{
    "title": "Ape TD: Tower Takeover",
    "description": "Lead your ape army to victory in 'Ape TD: Tower Takeover'! Defend against invaders, conquer towers, and master strategic defense. Explore diverse landscapes, form alliances, and become the Ape World's ultimate conqueror. Will you rise to rule in this epic adventure?\r\n\r\nGlorious rewards await those brave enough to go to war in Ape TD: Tower Takeover!\r\n\r\n- Manage your outpost, build an army, become the most powerful monkey of your Clan and lead them to war in this free MMO strategy game!\r\n- From defeating Mutant Monkey to stealing precious resources from other Clans, you can contribute to your monkey Clan in many ways and be the hero of all primates! \r\n- What will your strategy be to win this post-apocalyptic space race?\r\n\r\nCOOPERATION\r\n\u2022 Choose to be part of an elite pack of monkeys, in one of the 6 legendary Clans\r\n\u2022 Fight monkeys from other Clans and take part in massive PVP wars!\r\n\u2022 Make friends with other players of your Gang!\r\n\r\nSTRATEGY\r\n\u2022 Develop your outpost to dominate the monkey world\r\n\u2022 Create your own army and train the most powerful monkeys!\r\n\u2022 Plan to get ahead of the other Clans in the Rocket race!\r\n\r\nEXPLORATION\r\n\u2022 From Roger the Intendant to Junior one of the powerful Clan Leaders, meet our cast of awesome monkeys\r\n\u2022 Fight PVE battles against the terrifying Mutant Monkeys.\r\n\u2022 Travel all around the map, discover ancient Ruins, and huge Bosses!\r\n\r\nCOMMUNICATION\r\n\u2022 Plan strategies with your allies through our new unique social system!\r\n\u2022 Become a famous monkey, get many followers, and follow other primates too!\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTE: This game requires an internet connection to play.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Lead your ape army to victory in &#39;Ape TD: Tower Takeover&#39;! Defend against invaders, conquer towers, and master strategic defense. Explore diverse landscapes, form alliances, and become the Ape World&#39;s ultimate conqueror. Will you rise to rule in this epic adventure?<br><br>Glorious rewards await those brave enough to go to war in Ape TD: Tower Takeover!<br><br>- Manage your outpost, build an army, become the most powerful monkey of your Clan and lead them to war in this free MMO strategy game!<br>- From defeating Mutant Monkey to stealing precious resources from other Clans, you can contribute to your monkey Clan in many ways and be the hero of all primates! <br>- What will your strategy be to win this post-apocalyptic space race?<br><br>COOPERATION<br>\u2022 Choose to be part of an elite pack of monkeys, in one of the 6 legendary Clans<br>\u2022 Fight monkeys from other Clans and take part in massive PVP wars!<br>\u2022 Make friends with other players of your Gang!<br><br>STRATEGY<br>\u2022 Develop your outpost to dominate the monkey world<br>\u2022 Create your own army and train the most powerful monkeys!<br>\u2022 Plan to get ahead of the other Clans in the Rocket race!<br><br>EXPLORATION<br>\u2022 From Roger the Intendant to Junior one of the powerful Clan Leaders, meet our cast of awesome monkeys<br>\u2022 Fight PVE battles against the terrifying Mutant Monkeys.<br>\u2022 Travel all around the map, discover ancient Ruins, and huge Bosses!<br><br>COMMUNICATION<br>\u2022 Plan strategies with your allies through our new unique social system!<br>\u2022 Become a famous monkey, get many followers, and follow other primates too!<br><br><br>NOTE: This game requires an internet connection to play.",
